OL,3,GNEWSAMatches postponed as fans worry
OL,4,Aclub could fold
OL,5,
OL,6,FA non-league football club that is in
OL,7,Fdire straits has had its next two
OL,8,Fleague matches postponed.
OL,10,FThe Isthmian Football League confirmed
OL,11,Fit was postponing Maldon & Tiptree's
OL,12,Fmatches against Cray Wanderers on
OL,13,FSaturday and Brentwood Town on Monday.
OL,15,FFans of the Essex team said the club's
OL,16,Frepresentatives had told some
OL,17,Fsupporters they intended to wind up its
OL,18,Faffairs.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
